 * @summary The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`).
 * @remarks The parent `modal`'s `-density-compact` and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers.
 * @structure
 * @component modal {
 *   .footer {
