 * @example -automatica11y
 * ```html
 * <nav class="pfx-side-nav-bar" aria-label="Primary">
 *   <a class="item -selected" href="#">
 *     <span class="pfx-icon -icon-house"></span>
 *     <span class="label">Home</span>
 *   </a>
 *   <a class="item" href="#">
 *     <span class="pfx-icon -icon-inbox"></span>
