          ` * @modifier -cq-hidden-max-${short} — Hide when the marked container is at or below the \`${short}\` breakpoint (\`${w}\`).`,
          ` * @modifier -cq-hidden-min-${short} — Hide when the marked container is at or above the \`${short}\` breakpoint (\`${w}\`).`,
